        <description>JPS 6 Oct 2025 - For a Stock Transfer, in the purchase order transfer wizard, set the Account to Adept Turnkey. Set Location from Account in stock transfer if &quot;Use this Account for Stock Transfer&quot; is checked. [AT-50]</description>
