    </decisions>
    <description>JPS 16 Oct 2025 - Remove stock transfer and purchase order creation  for project record [AT-58]
JPS 6 Oct 2025 - For a Stock Transfer, in the purchase order transfer wizard, set the Account to Adept Turnkey. [AT-50]
JPS 9 Sept 2025 - Fix &quot; FIELD_INTEGRITY_EXCEPTION: Enter the same currency as the parent Order.: Currency ISO Code&quot; error [AT-45]
JPS 04 Aug - Fix quantityToOrder assignment logic (https://bricoleur.atlassian.net/browse/AT-37)
WM 4 August - check quantity to order
WM 28 July for purchase orders, use quantity to order from stock transfer subflow
WM 17 July Purchase Order Account should be product preferred supplier, not order / project account.  Additional processing logic where purchase order already exsts
WM 7 July - assign warehouse to order as well from project
WM 26 June refactor
WM 9 June - create stock transfer before purchase order</description>
